    <title>Image with Caption</title>
    <style>
        /* Center the image */
        .container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh; /* Full viewport height */
        }

        /* Style for the container containing the image and caption */
        .container img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 5px; /* Optional: Rounded corners */
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* Optional: Shadow effect */
        }

        /* Style for the caption */
        .caption {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1; /* Ensure the caption is on top of the image */
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            width: 30%; /* Adjust based on your needs */
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in-out; /* Optional: Animation to fade in the caption */
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to   { opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <img src="image.jpg" alt="Image">
    <div class="caption">Caption goes here</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```

### Explanation:
