  - `position: relative;` places the caption element inside the `.container`.
  - `z-index: 1;` ensures the caption appears above the image.
  - `background-color` and `padding` style provide some space around the caption.
  - `left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);` centers the caption within the container.
  - An optional keyframe animation (`@keyframes fadeIn`) can be used to animate the appearance of the caption over time.

